<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Perfil - Shakira</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fceabb, #f8b500); /* Cores quentes como o ouro da Colômbia */
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 450px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .profile-img {
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 6px solid #f8b500;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
            color: #d97706;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        p {
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .tags {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        .tag {
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .highlight {
            background: #d97706;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .highlight:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1501386761578-eac5c94b800a?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=400" alt="Microfone e Luzes" class="profile-img">
    
    <h1>Shakira</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Rainha do Pop Latino</div>
    
    <p>Cantora, compositora, dançarina e filantropa colombiana. Conhecida por sua voz única, dança do ventre e hits que uniram o mundo inteiro.</p>
    
    <div class="tags">
        <span class="tag">Grammy Winner</span>
        <span class="tag">Pies Descalzos</span>
        <span class="tag">Hips Don't Lie</span>
        <span class="tag">Waka Waka</span>
    </div>

    <p style="font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #777;">
        "As mulheres já não choram, as mulheres faturam."
    </p>

    <a href="#" class="highlight">Ouvir Agora</a>
</div>

</body>